# P is powered through the air cell above it (quasi-connectivity) and extends 2gt after the
# lever. Q is powered the same way by a redstone block two cells up, but nothing updates it, so
# it stays retracted until a block is placed next to it.
design designs/gadgets/qc-bud.txt
probe P 2 1 0
probe Q 4 1 0
use 0 2 0
expect_trace P rEEE
expect P E
set 4 3 0 minecraft:redstone_block
expect_trace Q rrrrrrrr
set 5 1 0 minecraft:stone
expect_trace Q EEE
